<title>JAPAN: BOJ says governor away for BIS meet from Sept 7.</title>
<headline>BOJ says governor away for BIS meet from Sept 7.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend a monthly meeting of the Bank for International Settlement (BIS) in Basle, Switzerland, a BOJ statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The governor will leave Japan on September 7 and return on September 10, it said.</p>
